'''The Sinkhole''' was the name given by the [[scrumrat]]s to the audience chamber of the [[Den of the White Worms|lair]] owned by the [[White Worms]] gang. The gang's leader, [[Lady]] [[Proxima]], lived in a pond within the Sinkhole, and rose from the pond when she wanted to speak with her underlings.<ref name="Most Wanted" />

